sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant SWController as Smartwatch<br/>Controller
    participant SWService as Smartwatch<br/>Service
    participant GoogleFitAdapter as Google Fit<br/>Adapter
    participant GoogleFit as Google Fit<br/>API

    User->>Browser: Click Connect Google Fit
    Browser->>SWController: GET /smartwatch/connect
    SWController->>SWService: start_oauth(user_id)
    SWService->>GoogleFitAdapter: get_auth_url()
    GoogleFitAdapter->>GoogleFit: Build OAuth URL
    GoogleFit-->>GoogleFitAdapter: OAuth URL + state
    GoogleFitAdapter-->>SWService: Return URL
    SWService-->>SWController: Redirect to Google OAuth
    SWController-->>Browser: 302 Redirect
    Browser->>GoogleFit: User authorizes scope
    GoogleFit-->>Browser: Callback with auth_code
    Browser->>SWController: GET /smartwatch/callback?code=...
    SWController->>SWService: exchange_code_for_token()
    SWService->>SWService: save_watch_account()
    
    User->>Browser: Click Manual Sync
    Browser->>SWController: POST /smartwatch/manual-sync
    SWController->>SWService: pull_vitals + store + risk check
    SWController-->>Browser: JSON sync result
